                                "html": "<div class=\"aries-event-list\">\n    <span>Formula 1</span>\n    <span class=\"event-separator\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M8 1L10 5.5H14L11 8.5L12.5 13L8 10.5L3.5 13L5 8.5L2 5.5H6L8 1Z\" fill=\"#c91c1c\"/><path d=\"M8 0.5C8 0.5 3 3 2 6C1 9 2.5 12 4 14C5 15 7 15.5 8 15.5C9 15.5 11 15 12 14C13.5 12 15 9 14 6C13 3 8 0.5 8 0.5Z\" stroke=\"#c91c1c\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" fill=\"none\" opacity=\"0.3\"/></svg></span>\n    <span>Tortuga</span>\n    <span class=\"event-separator\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M8 1L10 5.5H14L11 8.5L12.5 13L8 10.5L3.5 13L5 8.5L2 5.5H6L8 1Z\" fill=\"#c91c1c\"/><path d=\"M8 0.5C8 0.5 3 3 2 6C1 9 2.5 12 4 14C5 15 7 15.5 8 15.5C9 15.5 11 15 12 14C13.5 12 15 9 14 6C13 3 8 0.5 8 0.5Z\" stroke=\"#c91c1c\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" fill=\"none\" opacity=\"0.3\"/></svg></span>\n    <span>Doral food and wine festival</span>\n    <span class=\"event-separator\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M8 1L10 5.5H14L11 8.5L12.5 13L8 10.5L3.5 13L5 8.5L2 5.5H6L8 1Z\" fill=\"#c91c1c\"/><path d=\"M8 0.5C8 0.5 3 3 2 6C1 9 2.5 12 4 14C5 15 7 15.5 8 15.5C9 15.5 11 15 12 14C13.5 12 15 9 14 6C13 3 8 0.5 8 0.5Z\" stroke=\"#c91c1c\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" fill=\"none\" opacity=\"0.3\"/></svg></span>\n    <span>COVID Sites</span>\n    <span class=\"event-separator\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M8 1L10 5.5H14L11 8.5L12.5 13L8 10.5L3.5 13L5 8.5L2 5.5H6L8 1Z\" fill=\"#c91c1c\"/><path d=\"M8 0.5C8 0.5 3 3 2 6C1 9 2.5 12 4 14C5 15 7 15.5 8 15.5C9 15.5 11 15 12 14C13.5 12 15 9 14 6C13 3 8 0.5 8 0.5Z\" stroke=\"#c91c1c\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" fill=\"none\" opacity=\"0.3\"/></svg></span>\n    <span>CVS</span>\n</div>",
